# AI Resume Builder 🚀

An intelligent web-based application that helps users create professional, well-structured, and ATS-friendly resumes with ease.

## 📌 Project Overview

The AI Resume Builder is designed to simplify the resume creation process. Users can enter their personal information, educational qualifications, technical skills, work experience, projects, and achievements to generate a professional resume.

The application provides a user-friendly interface with real-time resume preview, allowing users to view changes instantly while editing their details.

## 🎯 Objectives

- Simplify the resume creation process.
- Help users create professional resumes.
- Provide an easy-to-use interface for entering resume details.
- Generate structured and ATS-friendly resumes.
- Reduce the time and effort required to prepare a resume.

## ✨ Features

- **Personal Information:** Add name, email, phone number, and location.
- **Professional Summary:** Write a professional introduction.
- **Education Details:** Include qualifications, institutions, and graduation years.
- **Technical Skills:** Highlight programming languages, tools, and technologies.
- **Work Experience:** Add internships and professional experience.
- **Projects:** Showcase academic and personal projects.
- **Certifications:** Include relevant certifications and achievements.
- **Live Resume Preview:** View resume changes instantly.
- **Professional Formatting:** Generate a clean and structured resume.
- **PDF Export:** Download the completed resume as a PDF.

