## 🏗️ System Workflow

1. User opens the AI Resume Builder.
2. User enters personal and professional details.
3. Application processes the entered information.
4. Resume content is organized into structured sections.
5. User previews and reviews the generated resume.
6. User downloads the final resume.


*Update the structure according to your actual project folders.*

## ⚙️ Installation and Setup

### 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/AI-Resume-Builder.git
```

### 2. Navigate to the Project Folder

```bash
cd AI-Resume-Builder
```

### 3. Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 4. Run the Application

```bash
python app.py
```

### 5. Open in Browser

```text
http://127.0.0.1:5000
```

